{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w13798"},"reason":"The card asked which university 'annually awards' the Ig Nobel Prizes; Harvard never awarded them (the magazine Annals of Improbable Research does) and the ceremony left Harvard after 2019 (MIT 2024, Boston University 2025, Zurich 2026). Reworded to ask which university's Sanders Theatre hosted the ceremony every year from 1995 until the pandemic; card text kept in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://improbable.com/ig/about-the-ig-nobel-prizes/"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which university annually awards the Ig Nobel Prizes for questionable scientific achievements, such as the invention of the pink plastic garden flamingo?","new":"At which university's Sanders Theatre were the Ig Nobel Prizes – honours for odd achievements such as the invention of the pink plastic garden flamingo – presented every year from 1995 until the pandemic?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welche Universität vergibt jährlich die Ig-Nobelpreise für fragwürdige wissenschaftliche Leistungen, wie z. B. die Erfindung des rosafarbenen Gartenflamingos?","new":"An welcher Universität wurden die Ig-Nobelpreise – Ehrungen für kuriose Leistungen wie die Erfindung des rosafarbenen Plastik-Gartenflamingos – von 1995 bis zur Pandemie jedes Jahr im Sanders Theatre verliehen?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какой университет ежегодно присуждает Шнобелевские премии за сомнительные научные достижения — например, за изобретение розового садового фламинго?","new":"В Сандерс-театре какого университета с 1995 года и до пандемии ежегодно вручали Шнобелевские премии — награды за курьёзные достижения вроде изобретения розового пластикового садового фламинго?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Welche Universität vergibt jährlich die Ig-Nobelpreise für fragwürdige wissenschaftliche Leistungen, wie z. B. die Erfindung des rosafarbenen Gartenflamingos?"}],"hash":"ea706d41a720","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"prov